{
  "id": "praesens",
  "name": "Present tense: regular -ar, -er, -ir verbs",
  "level": "A1",
  "variety": "es-ES",
  "es419": { "note": "In Latin America the vosotros forms (habláis, coméis, vivís) are not used. Ustedes hablan, comen, viven is used for everyone." },
  "subtitle": "Spanish verbs end in -ar, -er or -ir. Take off the ending and add the one for the person: hablar → hablo, hablas, habla. Use the present for now, for habits and for facts.",
  "briefMarks": ["-ar", "-er", "-ir", "-o", "-as", "-es"],
  "source": "icanspeak Spanish original text (grammar-a1 run, 2026-11-04)",
  "concept": {
    "qaWithTable": true,
    "flow": [
      { "text": "stem: habl-", "variant": "prep" },
      { "text": "ending: -o, -as, -a …", "variant": "verb" },
      { "text": "hablo, hablas, habla" }
    ],
    "exampleHtml": "Trabaj<span class=\"vp-verb\">o</span> en un hotel. · ¿Com<span class=\"vp-verb\">es</span> en casa? · Viv<span class=\"vp-verb\">imos</span> en Vigo.",
    "table": {
      "caption": "Present tense: the endings",
      "rows": [
        { "pron": "yo", "end": "-o" },
        { "pron": "tú", "end": "-as / -es" },
        { "pron": "él, ella, usted", "end": "-a / -e" },
        { "pron": "nosotros/as", "end": "-amos / -emos / -imos" },
        { "pron": "vosotros/as", "end": "-áis / -éis / -ís" },
        { "pron": "ellos, ellas, ustedes", "end": "-an / -en" }
      ],
      "verbs": [
        { "inf": "hablar", "forms": ["habl|o", "habl|as", "habl|a", "habl|amos", "habl|áis", "habl|an"] },
        { "inf": "comer", "forms": ["com|o", "com|es", "com|e", "com|emos", "com|éis", "com|en"] },
        { "inf": "vivir", "forms": ["viv|o", "viv|es", "viv|e", "viv|imos", "viv|ís", "viv|en"] }
      ]
    },
    "qa": [
      {
        "html": "Each ending shows the person, so you do not need <em>yo</em> or <em>tú</em>: <em>Hablo español. ¿Hablas inglés?</em>",
        "tag": "The ending"
      },
      {
        "html": "<strong>-er</strong> and <strong>-ir</strong> verbs have the same endings, except <em>nosotros</em> and <em>vosotros</em>: <em>comemos, coméis</em> but <em>vivimos, vivís</em>.",
        "tag": "-er and -ir"
      },
      {
        "html": "The present is for what happens <strong>now</strong>, for <strong>habits</strong> and for <strong>facts</strong>: <em>Hoy trabajo en casa. Los lunes como con mi madre. Vivo en Murcia.</em>",
        "tag": "When"
      },
      {
        "html": "To say “not”, put <strong>no</strong> before the verb: <em>No hablo alemán.</em> There is no word like <em>do</em>: <em>¿Trabajas hoy?</em>",
        "tag": "no"
      },
      {
        "html": "The stress matters: <em>hablo</em> (I speak) is not <em>habló</em> (he spoke). In the <em>vosotros</em> form the accent is always written: <em>habláis, coméis, vivís</em>.",
        "tag": "Accents"
      }
    ],
    "noteHtml": "Common mistakes: ✗ <em>Yo hablar español</em> → ✓ <em>Hablo español</em>. ✗ <em>Ella vivo aquí</em> → ✓ <em>Ella vive aquí</em>. ✗ <em>Comimos</em> for “we eat” → ✓ <em>Comemos</em>. Other verbs change more: <a href=\"/present-continuous\">Key irregular verbs</a> and <a href=\"/was-were\">Stem-changing verbs</a>.",
    "reference": {
      "showLabel": "Show overview ▼",
      "hideLabel": "Hide overview ▲",
      "tables": [
        {
          "caption": "Regular verbs to learn first",
          "head": ["-ar", "-er", "-ir"],
          "rows": [
            ["hablar (speak)", "comer (eat)", "vivir (live)"],
            ["trabajar (work)", "beber (drink)", "escribir (write)"],
            ["estudiar (study)", "leer (read)", "abrir (open)"],
            ["comprar (buy)", "aprender (learn)", "recibir (receive)"],
            ["llamar (call)", "vender (sell)", "subir (go up)"],
            ["pagar (pay)", "comprender (understand)", "compartir (share)"]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "boxes": [
        {
          "badge": "Careful: three endings for nosotros",
          "variant": "dat",
          "items": [
            "hablar → hablamos",
            "comer → comemos",
            "vivir → vivimos"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
